+Policy:
+
+```http
+PUT /v1/platform/client-policy
+{
+  "role": "FACTORY",
+  "platform": "android",
+  "channel": "enterprise",
+  "minimum_version": "1.2.0",
+  "recommended_version": "1.2.0",
